  "explanation": "The question asks for the director of the film \"Game of Death,\" but the sources refer to multiple films with similar titles. D1S1 explicitly states that Chukiat Sakveerakul directed the 2006 Thai film *13: Game of Death*. D3S3 mentions Robert Clouse's 1978 film titled *Game of Death*, which is distinct. D4S3 and D5S1/D6S5 refer to the 2010 film *Game of Death* directed by Giorgio Serafini. Since each refers to a different film with the same name, all three directors are valid answers depending on the specific film intended. Ng See-yuen (D2S1) is associated with *Game of Death II*, a separate film and thus excluded."
